<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos sees 205.789 mln pesos 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Cosmos sees 205.789 mln pesos 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine soft drinks concern Cosmos Bottling Corp said on Friday it expected a net income in full-year 1996 of 205.789 million pesos against 1995 net of 144 million pesos.  </p>
<p>It said in a statement this projection was based on expected total sales of 1.765 billion pesos for 1996. Sales in the first half of the year were 767.67 million pesos.</p>
<p>Cosmos, a unit of food-based conglomerate RFM Corp, launches a one-for-five rights offering on October 10 at a price of 2.10 pesos per share.</p>
<p>It shares closed on Thursday at 3.40 pesos.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8914</p>
